    <h1>Brand <em>guidelines.</em></h1>
    <p class="summit-lead">The visual standards behind Summit, on the website, on a proposal, on a service report, on a truck. Engineered first, decorated never.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="summit-section">
  <div class="summit-container">
    <span class="summit-eyebrow">01 / Palette</span>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.85rem,1.5rem+1.25vw,2.6rem);letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:var(--su-navy-deep);margin:0.5rem 0 0.75rem">Six colors. Cyan and navy carry the brand.</h2>
    <p style="max-width:62ch;color:var(--su-text);margin:0 0 2rem">Cyan and navy are the structural pair, blueprint blue. Pale and ice soften long-form pages and mimic technical-paper backgrounds. White is for diagrams. Ink is the body color.</p>

